# Color codes for output
RED='\033[0;31m'
GREEN='\033[0;32m'
YELLOW='\033[1;33m'
BLUE='\033[0;34m'
NC='\033[0m' # No Color

# Default configuration
TOOLS_DIR="$(cd "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")" && pwd)"
LOG_FILE="${TOOLS_DIR}/nlm_tools.log"
CONFIG_DIR="${TOOLS_DIR}/../configs"
BUILD_DIR="${TOOLS_DIR}/../build"

# Logging function
log() {
    local level=$1
    local message=$2
    local timestamp=$(date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S')
    
    case $level in
        INFO)
            color="$GREEN"
            prefix="[INFO]"
            ;;
        WARN)
            color="$YELLOW"
            prefix="[WARN]"
            ;;
        ERROR)
            color="$RED"
            prefix="[ERROR]"
            ;;
        DEBUG)
            color="$BLUE"
            prefix="[DEBUG]"
            ;;
    esac
    
    echo -e "${color}${timestamp} ${prefix} ${message}${NC}" | tee -a "$LOG_FILE"
}

